      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "甚至还说她听见了海浪声。\n这阵子状况低迷的原因成谜……\n不知是否赶得及在“樱花赏”前恢复精神？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd57a2bea1fd08dc4036ec89033b59f0611f674d57114411e27dd2b6993f6e64",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
