    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97dea40a919ff889feccb24b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "毫无预兆地当众宣布将放弃后冠路线，\n改跑短距离路线！两位劲敌虽然惊讶，\n但也称赞她的果断。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e468117d50eec5917c2882ebc6e065de463d8de1e58146c03cfc7c0fd37604a3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087403.json",
      "json_path": [
