      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01c07d11aa2dfa9354ead76b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在大家的加油打气之下，真弓快车也说出\n下一个目标是“短途马锦标”。\n另一方面──",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cb769770e2aebe78a06a8067c0ea4a0e65195f3164f21a4278b5a9ee6ad94d4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e77b677aea2659b3b00f987",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb3469705f3334ec02d7d9ee",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她决定变更路线前没先跟训练员讨论……\n训练员发誓一定要变得更可靠，\n希望以后不会再被她抛在脑后。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d42418325fb7795aa79aa34de94e60ff146aacf21b13bcce0909de46900d708",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cecce35135d48350ee505500",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "前往能够成为太阳的地方",
      "source_fingerprint": "a978e7280d3bf7dfb6afb37f73830df973581b97e6b67eed25e4cbe058b1c0ba",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09c89c3a539f8ec45c93b2b3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087404.json",
      "json_path": [
