    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f8e9428cdd96b61f2d34c1a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员梦见某个人来向自己道别。\n然而却想不起来对方的身份。\n梦中人究竟是谁呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebe86290cbdfbc0607516952ab9642c30da76b7d551aa17f32e934fd85e9578c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52232aacc48cbe89e4f8a429",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4892d92fbe533d73a3d36b9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最后是布偶唤醒了他的梦中记忆。\n真弓快车的真弓布偶。\n但此时她本人却四处都不见踪迹。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9750dc32b9f5e64f34162852f7421bbfcac041072637a6fe6aa85b767bf9ec84",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd6b51bb20670e1a4885ff51",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dde4606de21f9dfbca6daac8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最后终于在海边找到她。\n她道别后便转身面向大海，\n训练员出声挽留了她",
      "source_fingerprint": "4fea5cd1f739e4b0e65ab236dffbed4746572e7b094e55b9920d2bb161f21d44",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c02d73b95d6b7e9efd7ba8c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac1a37a2fcb6666f3fbaac0f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "请你留在我身边，而不是只留在记忆里。\n真弓快车的大好未来才正要开始。\n这番话……令她停下脚步。",
      "source_fingerprint": "15a9a8a19aadf8597e1ba7c1d12c26bad76a8e945784b096e8d0551733b037a9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f9c6f6f096b8a383f340225",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1087/storytimeline_501087404.json",
      "json_path": [
