      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "此时伏特加突然闯入！她热血地当众宣战，\n声称自己会是今日冠军。这番发言\n令在场媒体与观众为之沸腾。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d1728a19ea728729b71de8f74df163b2be1236b13a815f351d38bfe904bb8a9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
